### 模板 3：Systemd 服务单元（`service.template`）
> 适用纯 Linux 宿主机原生守护，保存至 `/etc/systemd/system/<service-name>.service`。

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Backend Microservice - %I
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=deploy
Group=deploy
WorkingDirectory=/data/app/backend
ExecStart=/usr/bin/java -Xms512m -Xmx1g -XX:+UseG1GC -jar /data/app/backend/%I-exec.jar
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=10s
StandardOutput=append:/data/app/backend/logs/%I.log
StandardError=append:/data/app/backend/logs/%I.error.log
LimitNOFILE=65536

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```
- **管理命令**：
  ```bash
  sudo systemctl daemon-reload
  sudo systemctl enable --now mes-module-mcp   # 开机自启并立即运行
  sudo systemctl restart mes-module-mcp      # 重启服务
  sudo systemctl status mes-module-mcp       # 查看状态
  journalctl -u mes-module-mcp -f            # 查看实时系统日志
  ```

