### 模板 4：轻量 Docker Compose 容器化编排（`docker-compose.yml`）
> 适用容器化服务器，零安装复杂环境依赖。

```yaml
version: '3.8'

services:
  mes-module-mcp:
    image: eclipse-temurin:17-jre-jammy
    container_name: mes-module-mcp
    restart: unless-stopped
    working_dir: /app
    volumes:
      - ./mes-module-mcp-exec.jar:/app/app.jar
      - ./logs:/app/logs
    environment:
      - TZ=Asia/Shanghai
      - SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=prod
      - NACOS_SERVER_ADDR=192.168.1.100:8848
    ports:
      - "18818:18818"
